# Convenience / backward-compatible workstation aggregate.
#
# Canonical Homebrew ownership:
#   brew/groups/*.Brewfile          — profile package groups
#   brew/Brewfile.<component>       — optional --with components
#
# Prefer profile groups via bootstrap. This file aggregates core+modern+
# workstation+media+gui+infra for bare `./setup.sh` (legacy path).
# Do not add new package ownership here — edit the group/component Brewfile.
# scripts/tests/repository_contract_test.sh checks aggregate ↔ group drift.

